WAQF Framework Dual License
===========================

Copyright (c) 2026 Ridlo Abelian & Yayasan Amal Produktif Indonesia.

The WAQF Framework (Wijhah – 'Azam – Qiyam – Fahs × SAFT)
uses a dual-licensing model to keep the Prophetic Management methodology open
and properly attributed for human organizations while making schemas,
templates, and AI Agent tooling effortless to adopt in software.

