    even commercially.

Under the following terms:
  - Attribution — You must give appropriate credit to Ridlo Abelian
    (https://ridlo.id) and link to https://github.com/ridloabelian/waqf-framework,
    provide a link to the license, and indicate if changes were made.
  - ShareAlike — If you remix, transform, or build upon the material, you must
    distribute your contributions under the same license (CC BY-SA 4.0) as
